<title>USA: Pillowtex names new president.</title>
<headline>Pillowtex names new president.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pillowtex Corp said on Tuesday it named Jeffrey Cordes president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He had been executive vice president and chief financial officer and would retain the responsibilities as CFO, it said.  </p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to comment on whom Cordes was replacing.</p>
